{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:04.40] Oh, oh (Ayy)\n[00:05.20] Oh-oh (Ayy)\n[00:07.08] Ayy, Scheme you killed it\n[00:12.92] Oh, oh (Ayy)\n[00:13.20] Oh\n[Chorus]\n[00:13.52] I hate wasting time (Uh-huh)\n[00:14.76] She from the other side, call her Coraline (Uh-huh)\n[00:17.44] Uh, her demons on the rise, coming after my life\n[00:21.16] Uh, something in the air ain't right (Uh-uh)\n[00:23.02] No, she gave me a few pills (Uh)\n[00:24.82] Some blue and some white, oh\n[Verse 1]\n[00:27.40] Life is a bitch, and my struggles are mood swings\n[00:30.90] Other people may say that my life is a movie\n[00:34.28] Been filling my prescriptions, wish they were everlasting\n[00:37.74] I ain't sell my soul, I pawned it, can I have it back, please?\n[00:41.32] Give it up, stole back my soul, on the run\n[00:43.70] I'm sick of fist fightin' demons, I'm 'bout to grab me a gun\n[00:47.34] Gotta always keep going, I ain't ever giving up\n[00:50.98] I ain't never, Devil tried to take advantage, couldn't do it, I'm too clever\n[00:55.04] Downing pills got me noddin' off, keep it together\n[00:58.56] On the real, where's the fentanyl? It brings me pleasure\n[01:01.90] Don't matter if we take too much, long as we take it together\n[01:05.16] Waiting for these opiates to kick in, and it's taking forever, ha\n[01:09.98] Wockhardt sippin', I can taste it forever\n[01:12.18] Feel like I may fall in the double cup and stay there forever\n[01:15.38] I wonder which doctors discovered codeine\n[01:18.94] Probably a witch doctor, mixing the potion\n[Chorus]\n[01:22.00] I hate wasting time\n[01:23.30] She from the other side, call her Coraline\n[01:26.40] Uh, her demons on the rise, coming after my life\n[01:29.50] Uh, something in the air ain't right\n[01:31.58] No, she gave me a few pills (Uh)\n[01:33.38] Some blue and some white, oh\n[Verse 2]\n[01:35.46] Uh, okay, I ain't okay\n[01:38.92] Pain make me bleed, misery\n[01:41.24] There's a switchblade stuck in my brain\n[01:45.46] But I don't complain, I'll be straight\n[01:49.24] Pills in my brain, going insane\n[01:52.68] Dark shadow figures in the doorway\n[01:55.24] I tell myself, \"It's okay,\" uh\n[01:57.88] I'll be okay, I'll be okay\n[02:01.28] I ain't okay, okay (Potion)\n[Chorus]\n[02:02.18] I hate wasting time\n[02:04.44] She from the other side, call her Coraline\n[02:07.36] Uh, her demons on the rise, coming after my life\n[02:10.96] Uh, something in the air ain't right\n[02:12.44] No, she gave me a few pills (Uh)\n[02:15.14] Some blue and some white, oh","words":[[3.5,4.28,"[Intro]"],[4.4,4.42,"Oh,"],[4.46,4.68,"oh"],[4.72,4.84,"(Ayy)"],[5.2,6.42,"Oh-oh"],[6.46,6.8,"(Ayy)"],[7.08,7.32,"Ayy,"],[7.98,9.86,"Scheme"],[10.08,10.12,"you"],[10.3,11.68,"killed"],[12.82,12.88,"it"],[12.92,12.98,"Oh,"],[13.02,13.04,"oh"],[13.1,13.16,"(Ayy)"],[13.2,13.22,"Oh"],[13.26,13.44,"[Chorus]"],[13.52,13.52,"I"],[13.56,13.62,"hate"],[13.72,14.04,"wasting"],[14.08,14.14,"time"],[14.5,14.72,"(Uh-huh)"],[14.76,14.82,"She"],[14.94,15.12,"from"],[15.2,15.24,"the"],[15.28,15.66,"other"],[15.8,16.16,"side,"],[16.24,16.44,"call"],[16.5,16.54,"her"],[16.62,17.18,"Coraline"],[17.22,17.4,"(Uh-huh)"],[17.44,17.6,"Uh,"],[18.18,18.26,"her"],[18.38,18.8,"demons"],[18.9,19.0,"on"],[19.04,19.08,"the"],[19.26,19.62,"rise,"],[19.68,19.9,"coming"],[19.98,20.2,"after"],[20.28,20.4,"my"],[20.54,20.92,"life"],[21.16,21.18,"Uh,"],[21.22,21.62,"something"],[21.66,21.72,"in"],[21.76,21.82,"the"],[21.88,22.04,"air"],[22.08,22.16,"ain't"],[22.26,22.68,"right"],[22.84,22.94,"(Uh-uh)"],[23.02,23.04,"No,"],[23.08,23.2,"she"],[23.3,23.48,"gave"],[23.54,23.58,"me"],[23.64,23.64,"a"],[23.7,23.78,"few"],[23.94,24.3,"pills"],[24.42,24.52,"(Uh)"],[24.82,24.98,"Some"],[25.04,25.22,"blue"],[25.3,25.34,"and"],[25.44,25.64,"some"],[25.7,26.02,"white,"],[26.16,26.24,"oh"],[26.32,26.62,"[Verse"],[26.64,26.88,"1]"],[27.4,27.82,"Life"],[27.88,28.0,"is"],[28.08,28.08,"a"],[28.26,28.68,"bitch,"],[28.74,28.78,"and"],[28.84,28.98,"my"],[29.04,29.52,"struggles"],[29.6